      "content": "it’s not just \"needing a break\" though. there is no break. as soon as i sit down, someone needs something. if i stop, everything falls apart. it feels like my life belongs to everyone else and there’s no version of the future where I actually get to be free or even just breathe. it’s just this endless, heavy cycle that never ends.",
